sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Admin as Platform Admin<br/>(Helm client)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>(OpenShift only)
    participant HookJob as Post-Install Hook Job<br/>(xKS only)
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant Operator as rhods-operator /<br/>rhai-operator

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Admin,Operator: Flow 1: OpenShift Installation (rhai-on-openshift-chart)
        Admin->>K8sAPI: helm install rhai-on-openshift-chart<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
        K8sAPI->>OLM: Create Namespace + OperatorGroup + Subscription CRs<br/>RBAC auth
        OLM->>OLM: Install dependency operators<br/>(cert-manager, Kueue, RHCL, etc.)
        K8sAPI->>K8sAPI: Create DataScienceCluster CR
        K8sAPI->>K8sAPI: Create DSCInitialization CR
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Reconcile component deployments<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Admin,Operator: Flow 2: xKS Installation (rhai-on-xks-chart)
        Admin->>K8sAPI: helm install rhai-on-xks-chart<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
        K8sAPI->>K8sAPI: Create rhai-operator Deployment<br/>(direct, no OLM)
        K8sAPI->>HookJob: Launch post-install-crs Job<br/>Auth: rhai-post-install-hook SA
        HookJob->>K8sAPI: Create KubernetesEngine CR<br/>(AWS/Azure/CoreWeave)
        HookJob->>K8sAPI: Create Platform CR
        HookJob->>K8sAPI: Create Kserve + AIGateway CRs
        K8sAPI->>HookJob: Launch post-install-gateway Job
        HookJob->>CertMgr: Read CA Secret<br/>Auth: RBAC
        CertMgr-->>HookJob: CA certificate
        HookJob->>K8sAPI: Create GatewayClass + Gateway +<br/>Certificate CRs
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Reconcile component deployments<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Admin,Operator: Flow 3: Helm Sync to RHOAI-Build-Config
        participant GH as GitHub Actions
        participant BuildConfig as RHOAI-Build-Config<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

        Note right of GH: Triggered by push to rhoai-3.x branch
        GH->>GH: Checkout odh-gitops source<br/>Auth: GitHub App token
        GH->>BuildConfig: Checkout target repo<br/>Auth: GitHub App token
        GH->>GH: rsync charts to target
        GH->>BuildConfig: Commit and push chart updates<br/>Auth: GitHub App token
    end
